@host = http://localhost:5000
### 1. GET / (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sach bai tap (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. POST tao luot nop hop le (201 Created + Location, status = received)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200351",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/luuthanh205/CNTTK23D"
}

### 4. GET doc lai trang thai luot nop: received -> processing -> graded (200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST bai tap khong ton tai (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200351",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/luuthanh205/CNTTK23D"
}

### 7. GET id khong ton tai (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. POST negotiate dung duong dan (200 OK + connectionId)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. POST negotiate sai duong dan hub (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
